---
description: Prepare one modelDramaturgy evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ImmersiveProduction[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Read the script and production notes to identify scene goals, knowledge reveals, dependencies, and branching choices. Distinguish fixed dramatic obligations from improvisable material and preserve what each character and audience group can know at that point. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
